## 🔁 Alternate Message Example (Sometimes Messages Vary)

```
🔥 Trade signal: USD/JPY
HIGHER ⬆️
Set to: 1 MIN
```

### Updated Regex for Flexibility:

```python
pair_match = re.search(r'(Trading Pair:|Trade signal:)\s*([A-Z]{3}/[A-Z]{3})', message)
pair = pair_match.group(2) if pair_match else None
```

---

## 🛡️ Add Error Handling (Optional)

```python
if not all([pair, direction, trade_time]):
    print("⚠️ Incomplete signal — skipping trade.")
else:
    print("✅ Ready to execute trade!")
```

